&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;当期末減価&lt;br/&gt;償却累計額&lt;br/&gt;又は償却&lt;br/&gt;累計額&lt;br/&gt;(百万円)&lt;/p&gt;
